               },
               "body" : {
                  "content" : [
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "SOLVED (except maybe consider implicaitons a bit about using initializer_list).",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "content" : [
                                 {
                                    "content" : [
                                       {
                                          "text" : "in a ",
                                          "type" : "text"
                                       }
                                    ],
                                    "type" : "paragraph"
                                 }
                              ],
                              "type" : "listItem"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "orderedList"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "marks" : [
                                 {
                                    "attrs" : {
                                       "href" : "https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/language/initializer_list"
                                    },
                                    "type" : "link"
                                 }
                              ],
                              "text" : "member initializer list",
                              "type" : "text"
                           },
                           {
                              "text" : " of a constructor if ",
                              "type" : "text"
                           },
                           {
                              "marks" : [
                                 {
                                    "type" : "em"
                                 }
                              ],
                              "text" : "braced-init-list",
                              "type" : "text"
                           },
                           {
                              "text" : " is used",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "attrs" : {
                                 "url" : "https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/language/list_initialization"
                              },
                              "type" : "inlineCard"
                           },
                           {
                              "text" : " ",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "… coupled with:",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "content" : [
                                 {
                                    "content" : [
                                       {
                                          "text" : "Otherwise, the constructors of ",
                                          "type" : "text"
                                       },
                                       {
                                          "marks" : [
                                             {
                                                "type" : "code"
                                             }
                                          ],
                                          "text" : "T",
                                          "type" : "text"
                                       },
                                       {
                                          "text" : " are considered, in two phases:",
                                          "type" : "text"
                                       }
                                    ],
                                    "type" : "paragraph"
                                 }
                              ],
                              "type" : "listItem"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "bulletList"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "content" : [
                                 {
                                    "content" : [
                                       {
                                          "text" : "All constructors that take ",
                                          "type" : "text"
                                       },
                                       {
                                          "marks" : [
                                             {
                                                "type" : "code"
                                             }
                                          ],
                                          "text" : "std::initializer_list",
                                          "type" : "text"
                                       },
                                       {
                                          "text" : " as the only argument, or as the first argument if the remaining arguments have default values, are examined, and matched by ",
                                          "type" : "text"
                                       },
                                       {
                                          "marks" : [
                                             {
                                                "attrs" : {
                                                   "href" : "https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/language/overload_resolution"
                                                },
                                                "type" : "link"
                                             }
                                          ],
                                          "text" : "overload resolution",
                                          "type" : "text"
                                       },
                                       {
                                          "text" : " against a single argument of type ",
                                          "type" : "text"
                                       },
                                       {
                                          "marks" : [
                                             {
                                                "type" : "code"
                                             }
                                          ],
                                          "text" : "std::initializer_list",
                                          "type" : "text"
                                       }
                                    ],
                                    "type" : "paragraph"
                                 }
                              ],
                              "type" : "listItem"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "bulletList"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "content" : [
                                 {
                                    "content" : [
                                       {
                                          "text" : "If the previous stage does not produce a match, all constructors of ",
                                          "type" : "text"
                                       },
                                       {
                                          "marks" : [
                                             {
                                                "type" : "code"
                                             }
                                          ],
                                          "text" : "T",
                                          "type" : "text"
                                       },
                                       {
                                          "text" : " participate in ",
                                          "type" : "text"
                                       },
                                       {
                                          "marks" : [
                                             {
                                                "attrs" : {
                                                   "href" : "https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/language/overload_resolution#Implicit_conversion_sequence_in_list-initialization"
                                                },
                                                "type" : "link"
                                             }
                                          ],
                                          "text" : "overload resolution",
                                          "type" : "text"
                                       },
                                       {
                                          "text" : " against the set of arguments that consists of the elements of the braced-init-list, with the restriction that only non-narrowing conversions are allowed. If this stage produces an explicit constructor as the best match for a copy-list-initialization, compilation fails (note, in simple copy-initialization, explicit constructors are not considered at all).",
                                          "type" : "text"
                                       }
                                    ],
                                    "type" : "paragraph"
                                 }
                              ],
                              "type" : "listItem"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "bulletList"
                     },
                     {
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "so what is going on is that the initailizer_list<> arg - if it possibly can be - will be used.",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "MAYBE avoid this by changing VariantValue - to have an EXPLICIT on its conversion of iterable<vairable:value> to variabtvalue. This works badly with anything that might use initializer_lists!",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     }
                  ],
                  "type" : "doc",
                  "version" : 1
