      "customfield_10001" : "1_*:*_1_*:*_10684958_*|*_5_*:*_1_*:*_0",
      "customfield_10012" : "0|i004jz:",
      "customfield_10300" : "{}",
      "description" : {
         "content" : [
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "We get a variety of crazy bugs and/or failure to compile (depending on compiler) using {} instaed of () calls to base Iterable() CTOR in many cases. ",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "THis happens for all compilers so it must be my misundersnanding, so add ticket to diagnose and better understand.",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "Some of the problems seemed to be invoking TEMPORARIES (especailly with Sequnce<VariantValue> or Collection<VariantValue>",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "content" : [
                        {
                           "content" : [
                              {
                                 "text" : "       : inherited{static_cast<inherited&&> (Factory::Mapping_Factory<KEY_TYPE, MAPPED_VALUE_TYPE, KEY_EQUALS_COMPARER>{forward<KEY_EQUALS_COMPARER> (keyEqualsComparer)}())}",
                                 "type" : "text"
                              }
                           ],
                           "type" : "paragraph"
                        }
                     ],
                     "type" : "listItem"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "bulletList"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "and const inherited&, and neioterh worked. Just switchign to () worked.",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "But its more than tha. Tried",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            }
         ],
         "type" : "doc",
         "version" : 1
      },
